SOLUTION 1 DIC
    temp 20
    pH 7 charge
    units mmol/kgw
    C(4) 50
SOLUTION 2 Ca
    temp 20
    pH 7 charge
    units mmol/kgw
    Ca 50

MIX 1
    1 0.5
    2 0.5
SAVE solution 10

EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 10
    Calcite 0 0

REACTION_TEMPERATURE 10
    20 200 in 10

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file mix_heat_sel.txt
    -reset false
USER_PUNCH
    -headings step temp calcite_moles
10 PUNCH STEP_NO, TC, EQUI("Calcite")
END
